<title>USA: U.S. SDR rate moved to 1.36509.</title>
<headline>U.S. SDR rate moved to 1.36509.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The International Monetary Fund said the exchange value of the U.S. dollar against the SDR was 1.36509, versus 1.36657 yesterday and 1.20635 on July 1, 1974.</p>
<p>Other currency values against the SDR today (July 1, 1974 rates in parentheses) were.</p>
<p> Deutsche Mark     2.36625   (3.06809)</p>
<p> French Franc	7.95656   (5.82126)</p>
<p> Japanese Yen	172.711   (343.773)</p>
<p> Pounds Sterling   0.839126   (0.505474)</p>
<p> Australian Dlr    1.75710   (0.809889)</p>
<p> Aust Schilling    16.6473   (22.0097)</p>
<p> Belgian Franc     48.7576   (45.9249)</p>
<p> Canadian Dlr	1.90648   (1.16295)</p>
<p> Danish Kroner     8.99936   (7.23304)</p>
<p> Indonesian Rupiah 3300.79   (501.291)</p>
<p> Iranian Rial	2394.91   (81.6734)</p>
<p> Italian Lire	2324.73   (779.746)</p>
<p> Kuwait Dinar	0.415411   (0.351685)</p>
<p> Dutch Guilder     2.65865   (3.20316)</p>
<p> Norwegian Kroner  9.48874   (6.59386)</p>
<p> Saudi Arab Riyal  5.11226   (4.25788)</p>
